{
  "id": "ISSUE-FUNC-001",
  "type": "functional-data-loss",
  "title": "已结束会议记录中的译文只更新内存，重新进入后消失",
  "status": "resolved",
  "severity": "high",
  "rootCause": {
    "summary": "译文回填复用了 append；InMemoryTaskStore 与 SwiftDataTaskStore 都拒绝修改 ended 任务，UI 却先更新了内存 @State，形成“显示成功但未落盘”。",
    "files": [
      "Duiyi/Features/History/TaskDetailView.swift:223",
      "Duiyi/Services/Persistence/InMemoryTaskStore.swift:51",
      "Duiyi/Services/Persistence/SwiftDataTaskStore.swift:69"
    ]
  },
  "evidence": {
    "redTest": {
      "command": "mobilebuildmcp simulator test --only-testing:DuiyiTests/TaskStoreTests",
      "result": "3 passed, 2 failed",
      "failure": "InMemory 与 SwiftData 的 endedTaskTranslationBackfill 都读回空译文"
    },
    "greenTest": {
      "command": "同上",
      "result": "5 passed, 0 failed"
    },
    "fullUnitTest": {
      "command": "mobilebuildmcp simulator test --only-testing:DuiyiTests",
      "result": "120 passed, 0 failed"
    },
    "releaseBuild": "Duiyi / Release / device SUCCEEDED"
  },
  "fix": {
    "approach": "新增专用 updateTranslations 通道，只更新已有 TranscriptEntry 的 translatedText，并允许作用于 ended 任务；普通 append 继续保持 ended guard。",
    "files": [
      "Duiyi/Domain/TaskSession.swift",
      "Duiyi/Services/Persistence/InMemoryTaskStore.swift",
      "Duiyi/Services/Persistence/SwiftDataTaskStore.swift",
      "Duiyi/Services/Persistence/DeferredTaskStore.swift",
      "Duiyi/Features/History/TaskDetailView.swift",
      "DuiyiTests/TaskStoreTests.swift"
    ]
  },
  "knownFollowUp": [
    "ExportShareButton 使用 .task(id: task.id)，同一详情页内译文更新后导出 URL 可能仍是旧内容；作为独立问题处理，本次未混改。"
  ]
}
